{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/2/ef232f1c3f50a3c3557f43153502b25dec8d3bd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c3d445961027abe69c8eab3bb304b62a6ac4d4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{x}+\\dfrac{1}{2x}+\\dfrac{1}{3x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"37\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/8/ba83d681332ce51c07653d055acd05d371c0fc1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{2x}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{6x}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{6x}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{11}{6x}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{6x^3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"430\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f3c6262fbacae6ba07fea6f24758dde08078e97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/2/0f202ac4a26362804b94efe7bae0583ac1e01dcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{2x} + \\frac{1}{3x} = \\frac{6}{6x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"155\" height=\"38\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae00163047d3870d506140430457d16575d679ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{6x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"25\" height=\"38\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a2710bf1f249e4328cabd7d619688b72e379bfb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{6x} = \\boxed{\\left(\\mathbf{D}\\right) \\frac{11}{6x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"118\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td><